{
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "POL-NS-01 limb (a) is satisfied on the platform's own trip record: the record carries a driver 'arrived' event for this trip at 2026-08-17T18:41:25+08:00, together with the wait_timer_started event two seconds later at 18:41:27. The trip carries no boarding event and was terminated by the driver.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-TRIP-03103"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-01"],
      "relies_on": "trip_record.events",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "POL-NS-01 limb (b) and the POL-NS-02 proximity test are satisfied many times over. The pickup is a LARGE_VENUE zone, so the arrival radius is 120 m under the POL-NS-02 zone table, and the trace contains 39 consecutive admissible fixes inside that radius with zero coverage gaps and a maximum gap of 0 seconds - far beyond the three consecutive in-radius fixes POL-NS-02 requires. This is not a case where the only in-radius readings are stray low-accuracy fixes: the qualifying run is continuous.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-03103"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-02"],
      "relies_on": "derived.arrival.qualifying_fix_count",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "POL-NS-01 limb (c) is satisfied and POL-NS-06 has no shortfall to refund. The continuous in-geofence dwell, measured from the first qualifying in-geofence fix, runs from 18:41:25 to 18:47:45 - 380 seconds - against the free waiting period in force for this trip of 180 seconds carried on trip_record.platform_policy.free_wait_sec. The measured dwell exceeds the required minimum by 200 seconds (the derived shortfall figure is negative, i.e. a surplus). A driver who waits 6 minutes 20 seconds does not cancel prematurely.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-03103", "EV-TRIP-03103"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-01", "POL-NS-06"],
      "relies_on": "derived.arrival.longest_qualifying_run.duration_sec",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "POL-NS-01 limb (d) is satisfied. The trip record shows termination by the driver under cancellation_reason_code RIDER_NO_SHOW at 18:47:45, 380 seconds after the qualifying dwell began and long after the required dwell had elapsed, with no boarding event anywhere on the record. The reason code used is one of the three the limb recognises.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-TRIP-03103"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-01"],
      "relies_on": "trip_record.cancellation_reason_code",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "POL-NS-05 does not engage and there is no false arrival marker. The derived arrival offset between the 'arrived' event and the start of the in-geofence dwell is 0 seconds, and the qualifying run opens at the arrived event's own timestamp (18:41:25) with the driver's stationary fixes inside the radius from that moment; the trace corroborates the marker rather than contradicting it, so neither limb (i) nor limb (ii) of POL-NS-05 has anything to correct. Even if the marker were treated as false, the corrected dwell under limb (iii) is 380 seconds, the minimum is met, and POL-NS-01 governs so that the fee stands and POL-NS-07 fixes the payout.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-03103", "EV-TRIP-03103"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-05"],
      "relies_on": "derived.arrival.dwell_start_offset_sec",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The rider's POL-NS-04 route fails on its third limb, and it fails affirmatively rather than being undecidable. The rider's own track carries 67 fixes and ZERO qualifying fixes inside the 150 m rider-presence radius for LARGE_VENUE: his device sits between 715.5 m and 722.4 m from the pickup pin throughout. Limb (c) therefore fails on admissible fixes, POL-NS-04 cannot exonerate the rider, and the fee is decided under POL-NS-01. I do not need to contest limb (b): the driver posted 'hi im at the pickup point, where are you' at 18:41:50, 23 seconds after the waiting timer started, and the rider's reply 'coming down now' came 115 seconds later at 18:43:45.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-03103", "EV-CHAT-03103"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-04"],
      "relies_on": "derived.rider_presence.min_distance_m",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Taking the rider's own message at its highest, it does not help him. Four minutes after he wrote 'coming down now', at the moment of cancellation at 18:47:45, his device was still stationary and still more than 715 m from the pickup pin: his fixes from 18:38:51 to 18:48:50 report a single speed value of 0.0 kph and distances of 715 m to 722 m. Nothing on this record shows the rider approaching the pickup point at any time during the waiting window, which is why limb (d) - and the absence of any boarding event - is made out.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-03103", "EV-CHAT-03103"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-01"],
      "relies_on": "derived.rider_presence.max_distance_m",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "POL-NS-03 does not displace the fee. That clause governs a driver stationary OUTSIDE the arrival radius but within 400 m of the pin; here the driver's stationary fixes are inside the 120 m radius - 39 qualifying fixes - so the wrong-entrance branch is never reached. The record also shows a single registered pickup point within a venue-tagged location (venue_id VEN-NORTHPOINT), so the pin-ambiguity goodwill branch, which requires two or more registered pickup points, could not apply in any event.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-03103", "EV-TRIP-03103"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-03"],
      "relies_on": "derived.arrival.qualifying_fix_count",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "I disclose, rather than rely on, the advisory artifact: EV-ADVIS-03103-01 is MISSING, has no payload, carries the issue code MISSING_ARTIFACT and weight 0.0, and its note records that no advisory covers this pickup in this window. The driver does not need it and does not assert it. The dwell was one continuous in-geofence interval, so the accumulated-dwell limb of POL-NS-06(i) is not engaged, and this fee rests on the driver's own arrival and dwell evidence, not on any absent advisory.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-ADVIS-03103-01", "EV-GPS-03103"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-06", "POL-GEN-02"],
      "relies_on": "derived.arrival.accumulated_dwell.accumulated_sec",
      "asserted_weight": 0.0
    },
    {
      "text": "No artifact in this bundle is impaired, and no limb of POL-NS-08 is engaged: the arrived event matches a fix on the trace's own 10-minute-cadence grid with no clock skew, the trace has zero gaps and 100.0% coverage with 96 fixes and both tracks present, the chat log's 2 messages match trip_record.chat_message_count, and the fare line reconciles - platform_policy.cancellation_fee_sgd is 4.50 and the fare_breakdown cancellation fee and total charged are both 4.50, with payment_status CHARGED and refund_issued_sgd 0.00. Every artifact the driver relies on carries weight_multiplier 1.0, so nothing decides this case at a discount.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-FARE-03103", "EV-GPS-03103", "EV-CHAT-03103", "EV-TRIP-03103"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-08"],
      "relies_on": "derived.money.fee_charged",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The driver is entitled to compensation under POL-NS-07. POL-NS-01 is satisfied in full and no clause from POL-NS-03 to POL-NS-06 displaces it, so the payout is 80 percent of the cancellation fee in force for the trip - 80 percent of SGD 4.50, that is SGD 3.60, with the residual 20 percent retained as the platform service fee. The anti-farming check does not trip: driver_profile.no_show_terminations_30d is 2, below the count threshold of 4, and the rate against driver_profile.completed_trips_30d is 2 of 74, well under 0.08. Both limbs are required and neither is met. No other profile field is relied on for this check.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-FARE-03103", "EV-DPROF-03103", "EV-TRIP-03103"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-07"],
      "relies_on": "derived.money.driver_compensation",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "No escalation trigger in POL-NS-09 fires, so this case is decidable now and the fee should not be placed on hold. No two admissible artifacts contradict each other on arrival, dwell or rider presence; rider_profile.no_show_disputes_30d is 0 against a threshold of 3; both rider_profile.disputes_with_counterparty_90d and driver_profile.disputes_with_counterparty_90d are 0, far below the 2-or-more test; the POL-NS-07 anti-farming check does not trip; and no deciding fact rests on evidence impaired under POL-NS-08(a) to (d). The correct disposition is that the charge stands as it presently is, with the driver's compensation paid.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-RPROF-03103", "EV-DPROF-03103"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-09"],
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    }
  ]
}
